      en: ["Gateway to Taroko Park", "Marble mining industry", "Frequent earthquakes", "Famous for mochi sweets"],
      es: ["Puerta al Parque Taroko", "Industria del mármol", "Terremotos frecuentes", "Conocida por dulces Mochi"],
